{{TWExclusive}}
'''Crazed Baozi Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked during the [[New Years Event]] as a [[Daily Bonus]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.5]] and is exclusive to the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version via Package Version Bonus.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 285
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Crazed Baozi Cat
|name2 = Crazed Big Baozi Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Crazed Big Baozi Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role without relevant differences in quality. Crazed Baozi Cat, however, can be used in 4-crown [[Legend Stages]], where there is considerably less competition, plus it has a lead on most other meatshields thanks to his speed, which make him one of the best options, despite the low stats. Outside of 4-Crowns however, it faces direct competition from [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] who is faster and deals more damage, but Baozi can still be used alongside it in situations where [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]] is less desirable.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Due to the low stats, this form is not recommended as it is considerably worse than any possible alternative in about every way, making him into a waste of money when summoned. Could still be of use in early-mid [[Empire of Cats]], but, after that, it is best to revert this cat to Normal Form and only use that.

