==Trivia==
*When it initially released on August 2016, it would be unlocked by going to a website and entering the code "狂亂小籠包" ("frenzy dumplings") which would then distribute Crazed Baozi Cat to your save file. It would then be later unlocked by participating in the [[Anniversary/2nd Year|2nd Anniversary]] for the Taiwanese Version.
*It, [[Nekondo (Special Cat)|Nekondo]], [[Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Baozi Cat]], [[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie]], and [[Li'l Valkyrie Dark (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie Dark]] are part of a version exclusive in The Battle Cats Unite, only being obtained if the player owns the Southeast Asia version.

